recipeImport.prompt:
Read this recipe and convert it for my meal planner, FlavorFam: {link}

Reply with ONLY a JSON object, no other text, using plain straight quotes (") so it can be copied, in exactly this shape:
{ "title": "...", "category": "...", "servings": 4, "timeMinutes": 30, "ingredients": [ { "name": "...", "qty": 200, "unit": "g" } ], "steps": [ "..." ], "notes": "...", "source": "the recipe URL" }

Rules:
- category is one of: {categories}
- unit is one of: {units}. Convert cups, ounces, pounds and sticks to g or ml. Use pcs for whole items (eggs, onions, cloves).
- qty is a number above 0. Put prep details (chopped, optional) in notes, not in the name.
- Reuse these ingredient names when they match: {ingredients}
- timeMinutes is total time in minutes; leave it out if unknown.
- Keep steps short, one action each, in English.
- notes: at most 2 short sentences with only what's essential (e.g. a key substitution). No storage, make-ahead, pan sizes or recipe variations. Leave it out if there's nothing essential.
